{"id":"n66634-2-10","stage":4,"title":"쏠리다 · 集中","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66634-2-10-1","ko":"그렇게 텔레비전에만 관심이 쏠려 있어서 공부는 언제 하니?","zh":"你这么一门心思地看电视，什么时候才学习啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样，一般","explanation":"그렇다：那样，一般；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"5","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"텔레비전에만","meaning":"电视，电视机","explanation":"텔레비전：电视，电视机；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"텔레비전","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27373","senseId":"1","lemma":"텔레비전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"텔레비전에만","audio":"/audio/a574881403c51ce63061.mp3"}},{"text":"관심이","meaning":"关注，关心，兴趣","explanation":"관심：关注，关心，兴趣；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"관심","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60096","senseId":"1","lemma":"관심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관심이","audio":"/audio/0dba735a8454affdee7a.mp3"}},{"text":"쏠려","meaning":"集中","explanation":"쏠리다：集中；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쏠리다","audio":"/audio/0c14f66fb4acd9e4d8cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66634","senseId":"2","lemma":"쏠리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쏠려","audio":"/audio/cbcebb885496ebd9a9ca.mp3"}},{"text":"있어서","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어서","audio":"/audio/8c518243ad11245b602e.mp3"}},{"text":"공부는","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부는","audio":"/audio/9b97419fada8f066c750.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：疑问词“什么时候”；结合本句询问时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"하니?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니","audio":"/audio/917bc632330b55c71985.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，一般","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"不好或不太满意。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"f5472a609d9fa7b0","term":"텔레비전","zh":"电视，电视机","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3","entryId":"27373","definition":"接收电视台以电波传送的图像与声音后使其显示出来的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"07b3c15a29688a55","term":"관심","zh":"关注，关心，兴趣","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3","entryId":"60096","definition":"被某种东西吸引的情感和想法。","pronunciation":["관심"]},{"id":"0c14f66fb4acd9e4","term":"쏠리다","zh":"集中","audio":"/audio/0c14f66fb4acd9e4d8cb.mp3","entryId":"66634","definition":"视线或心思全部聚集到一处。","pronunciation":["쏠리다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"什么时候","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d36ec1485028cb0a3ed.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66634-2-10-2","ko":"이것만 보고 할 거예요.","zh":"看完这个我就去学习。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이것만","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이것만","audio":"/audio/e46bb3c64ed31f2d29c0.mp3"}},{"text":"보고","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고","audio":"/audio/ddf2aaf35f3c5a087464.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f853146771996111887.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.035,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66634","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7603,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看完这个我就去学习。","你到底要去哪儿，才会每天都偷偷摸摸地离开家啊？","你这么一门心思地看电视，什么时候才学习啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看完这个我就去学习。","你这么一门心思地看电视，什么时候才学习啊？","你到底要去哪儿，才会每天都偷偷摸摸地离开家啊？"],"answer":0}]}
